usage: sqfs-triage-v4.py [-h] [--skill SKILL.md] [--json] [--table-only]
                         [--selftest]
                         [ENVELOPE.json ...]

Label REA envelopes with the SKILL.md craft-section SquashFS triage table v4
(label and action).

positional arguments:
  ENVELOPE.json     REA envelope (bare data object or full CLI envelope)

options:
  -h, --help        show this help message and exit
  --skill SKILL.md  document holding the craft-section v4 triage table
  --json            print features, the matched rule and its action as JSON
  --table-only      validate the table and print the parsed rules and actions
  --selftest        run the isolated selftest
